'''Baited Expectations''' is a [[divination card]]. A set of eight can be exchanged for a random [[unique]] [[fishing]] item.

{{Item acquisition}}

{{il|Angler's Plait}} is an extremely rare outcome from this card, circumventing reward pool restrictions of other cards granting unique items.<ref name="Angler's Plait" />

